  "sources": [
    "Microwaves are produced by a magnetron, reflected within the metal interior, and absorbed by food; they make water molecules vibrate, producing heat; ovens do not cook 'from the inside out': https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/resources-you-radiation-emitting-products/microwave-ovens ; https://hyperphysics.gsu.edu/hbase/Waves/mwoven.html",
